CfModuleName=Pichinov — Fields per card
CfSetupTitle=Setup of the module Fields per card
CfSetupDesc=For each card and each mode (creation, modification, consultation), choose the MANDATORY fields and the HIDDEN fields, extrafields included. The setup of the fields in Dolibarr is not changed: these settings only apply in this module.
CfChangelog=Changelog
CfHideEmptyBlocks=Hide empty blocks in consultation
CfHideEmptyBlocksDesc=When all the fields of a block of the card (left or right half of the header) are hidden, the whole block is hidden: the lines come sooner on screen, useful on a mobile terminal.
CfSurveyAlways=Permanent survey
CfSurveyAlwaysDesc=Every card opened by an administrator (creation, modification, consultation) records its field rows. Disable it once the survey is done. Without this option, use the "Survey" links of each card.
