CfNoEditForm=This card has no modification form: fields are modified one by one on the card in consultation (pencil). "Mandatory" in modification refuses to save an emptied field; to stop seeing a field, hide it in consultation.
CfProductCreateDelegated=The product creation form is set in the module <a href="%s">Product quick create</a> (mandatory and hidden fields, own catalog, collapsible sections): it is not duplicated here. This module sets the modification and the consultation of products.
CfNoField=No known field for this card: run a survey (links above).
CfFieldsNote=A hidden field stays in the form with its default value (it is only hidden). A field cannot be both mandatory and hidden in the same mode. Fields required by Dolibarr (red label) are never hidden. The lines of the documents (products, quantities) are never touched.
CfFieldsSaved=Setup of the fields of the card %s saved
CfFieldsConflict=A field cannot be both mandatory and hidden: %s stay(s) mandatory and visible.
CfRequiredFieldsMissing=Mandatory fields not filled: %s. Nothing was saved.
CfRequiredFieldEmpty=The field "%s" is mandatory: it cannot be empty. The modification was not saved.
CfSurveyDesc=The module knows the fields written for the reception card and the extrafields of each card. To set the other fields of a card, run a <b>survey</b>: open the card in each mode with the links below (new tab); the rows really shown are recorded, then come back here and reload the page. A survey adds up: opening another variant (e.g. reception from a purchase order, individual third party) adds its rows.
